{:id :EACL-FORMAL-031
 :status :fixed
 :discovered-by :property
 :seed-or-trace
 "github-actions/formal/dafny-and-generated-boundaries/artifact-size"
 :minimized-fixture "fixture.edn"
 :impact :availability
 :affected-versions
 ["PR 101 commit cc9cd49328dc960e59eb8660172d125c269f3f6f"]
 :affected-backends [:shared]
 :root-cause
 "The generated-artifact size gate was implemented as a Babashka executable, but the formal GitHub Actions job installed Clojure, clj-kondo, and Node without installing Babashka. Every proof and generated build passed before the gate failed with /usr/bin/env: bb: No such file or directory."
 :fix
 "The obsolete Babashka manifest gate and exact tool-version assertion were removed. Production ClojureScript size and graph checks run as ordinary executable tests against freshly built bundles."
 :closing-evidence
 ["eacl.formal.cljs-production-gate-test/production-cljs-bundle-is-native-small-and-oracle-free-test"]}
